[h1]v2.2.3 - Patches and Compat Update[/h1]

[h2]Changelog[/h2]
[list]
  [*]Adds compatibility with [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3779561845]LG Extended Plumbing[/url]. When it's installed, PlumbingFixed now detects its building-wide pool marker and defers to it instead of pooling its own 3x3, preventing water from being double-counted between the two mods.
  [*]The Fluid Matrix window now shows a single reservoir bar with the combined total (instead of the 3x3 grid) for a fixture when using LG Extended Plumbing
  [*]Fixes the left reservoir menu not showing in the right spot for Washing Machines
[/list]
